  <sharedSelectionEntries>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Boons of Nurgle" hidden="false" id="4b1f-33a3-7520-94e0">
      <rules>
        <rule name="Nurgle&apos;s Gift (Aura)" id="c901-9b45-882b-9cae" hidden="false">
          <description>All Models with the Nurgle&apos;s Legion or Death Guard Company Keywords have the Nurgle&apos;s Gift (aura) starting from battleround 1, Enemy Models withing Contagion Range of these models suffer the effects of the selected Plagues of Nurgle.

Battle Round 1 = 3&quot;
Battle Round 2-3 = 7&quot;
Battle Round 4-5  = 14&quot;</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
